// "Cast <spell>" [CR#701.5a,701.5b]: take it from the zone it's in, put it on
// the stack and pay its costs [CR#601.2]. As an instruction it is that
// procedure carried out during resolution (`Procedure`), paying its own costs;
// "without paying its mana cost" is `castWithoutPaying`. A permission to cast
// ("you may cast …" for a duration) is a deontic rule, not this.
KeywordAction(
    name: "cast",
    params: [Subject],
    spelling: "cast <Param(0)>",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "cast",
        preterite: "cast",
        participle: "cast",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
    body: procedure(Cast, Param(0), ItsOwnCost),
)
